 background-color: #FFFFFF;">   <br/>    </td>     </tr>  <tr>     <td bgcolor="White" height="20" style="color: #FF0909; background-color: #FFFFFF;">     Note:- This is auto generated mail from HEXAVARSITY.       </td>     </tr>     </table>    </div>'
